seeker (0.1.2-1~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * New upstream version 0.1.2.
    - Preferences window (Appearance, Font and Size) with Save, Cancel, Close.
    - One font and text size for everything; no sliders.
    - Searches include hidden files and folders by default (fixes *.md).
    - Include Files / Include Folders: list matching files, folders or both.
    - Folder and file icons in the found list; Page Up/Down, Home/End keys.
    - Search form fits narrow windows and large text sizes.

 -- Eric Allen <trajic@tutanota.com>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:00:00 -0800

